WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:19.769
"Ugh!" Mo cried. "I can't do this!"

2
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.048
Mo was trying to grow big and spiky.

3
00:00:23.049 --> 00:00:27.388
But he still couldn't do it.

4
00:00:27.389 --> 00:00:31.231
Mo swam away.

5
00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:34.316
"Poor Mo," Cora thought.

6
00:00:34.317 --> 00:00:38.269
"He looks sad.

7
00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:41.467
I'll find something to cheer him up.

8
00:00:41.468 --> 00:00:50.377
Maybe some sea glass for his collection."

9
00:00:50.378 --> 00:00:53.900
Cora swam through Kelp Bottom.

10
00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:56.916
She swam around Jellyfish Bay.

11
00:00:56.917 --> 00:01:02.629
She picked up pieces of sea glass.

12
00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:13.709
"They're pretty," she thought. "Mo will love them!"

13
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:17.954
Cora swam back to Rainbow Reef.

14
00:01:17.955 --> 00:01:24.043
She put the sea glass in her den.

15
00:01:24.044 --> 00:01:29.090
When she came out, the reef looked empty.

16
00:01:29.091 --> 00:01:33.793
"Something is wrong," she thought.

17
00:01:33.794 --> 00:01:37.332
"Where is everyone?" Cora said.

18
00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:42.417
A swarm of tiny plankton rushed by.

19
00:01:42.418 --> 00:01:47.787
"Watch out! They're coming!"

20
00:01:47.788 --> 00:01:52.887
"Who's coming?" Cora looked around.

21
00:01:52.888 --> 00:01:56.520
Now she saw a strange green glow.

22
00:01:56.521 --> 00:01:59.831
There were lights all over the reef.

23
00:01:59.832 --> 00:02:02.817
"What is that?" she thought.

24
00:02:02.818 --> 00:02:08.687
"Psst, Cora!" It was Mo.

25
00:02:08.688 --> 00:02:14.269
He was hiding behind a rock.

26
00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:17.644
"What's happening?" Cora said.

27
00:02:17.645 --> 00:02:21.243
"There's a big problem," Mo said.

28
00:02:21.244 --> 00:02:24.406
"Jellyfish came to the reef.

29
00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:28.330
They're hunting for plankton!"

